{"leftColumnItems":[{"text":"万国之春第一包：天生烝民","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li>赫梯<ul><li>新文明<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/civilizations/CIVILIZATION_MER_HITTITES.html\">赫梯</a>，特色能力烈阳与暴风：忽略科技要求显示 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_IRON.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_IRON\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 铁资源。开发 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_IRON.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_IRON\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 铁的矿山提供+1 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 科技值、+1 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 生产力。每种已改良的战略资源给本城区域（市中心除外）+1 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 生产力，如果是 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_IRON.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_IRON\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 铁资源则额外 +1 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 科技值。</li><li>特色单位<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/MELEE/UNIT_EGYPTIAN_KHOPESH.html\">弯刀战士</a>：取代剑客的赫梯古典时代特色近战单位。攻击近战、抗骑兵和远程单位时+7 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_STRENGTH.png\" alt=\"ICON_STRENGTH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 战斗力。</li><li>特色单位<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/HEAVY_CAVALRY/UNIT_MER_ANSUKURRA.html\">赫梯战车</a>：取代重型战车的赫梯远古时代特色单位。战斗力更高，移动速度更快。在平坦单元格上开始回合不会获得 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_MOVEMENT.png\" alt=\"ICON_MOVEMENT\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 移动力加成，但能无视丘陵带来的 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_MOVEMENT.png\" alt=\"ICON_MOVEMENT\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 移动力减益。双倍支援加成。</li><li>特色建筑<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CAMPUS/BUILDING_MER_ROYAL_ARCHIVE.html\">皇家档案馆</a>：赫梯特色建筑，取代图书馆。+2影响力点数。本城已改良的战略资源+1 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 科技值。研究造纸术科技后，城市中每位 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CITIZEN.png\" alt=\"ICON_CITIZEN\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 公民 +0.3 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 科技值产出。</li><li>领袖<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/leaders/LEADER_MER_SUPPILULIUMA.html\">苏庇路里乌玛</a>，领袖能力纽带和誓言：成为宗主的每一个城邦类型为所有城市+10%对应产出。每个宗主城邦和同盟等级+1 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAVOR.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAVOR\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 外交支持。</li></ul></li><li>亚述<ul><li>新文明<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/civilizations/CIVILIZATION_BOOM_ASSYRIA_HD.html\">亚述</a>，特色能力阿苏尔之子民：在战斗中击杀一个单位时，所有相邻敌方单位失去10点生命值。焚毁城市时，在首都获得一个开拓者，且该城市每有1 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CITIZEN.png\" alt=\"ICON_CITIZEN\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 人口便获得20点 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 科技值。</li><li>特色单位<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/SUPPORT/UNIT_BOOM_SIEGE_ENGINE.html\">攻城车</a>：亚述远古时代特色支援单位，取代破城锤。<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_MOVEMENT.png\" alt=\"ICON_MOVEMENT\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 移动力更高。相邻的单位攻击区域时+5 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_STRENGTH.png\" alt=\"ICON_STRENGTH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 战斗力，防御远程攻击时+8 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_STRENGTH.png\" alt=\"ICON_STRENGTH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 战斗力。</li><li>特色单位<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/ANTI_CAVALRY/UNIT_ASSYRIA_KISIR_SARRUTI.html\">皇家禁卫</a>：亚述古典时期特色抗骑兵单位，取代长矛兵。<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_STRENGTH.png\" alt=\"ICON_STRENGTH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 战斗力更低，但解锁更早，<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_MOVEMENT.png\" alt=\"ICON_MOVEMENT\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 移动力更高且建造成本更低。初始便拥有1次免费升级。</li><li>特色改良<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/improvements/unique/IMPROVEMENT_BOOM_LAMASSU.html\">拉玛苏像</a>：解锁建造者建造亚述特色改良拉玛苏像的能力。+1 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 信仰值。获得所在城市市中心建筑（不包括宫殿）的基础产出。军营相邻拉玛苏像时+2 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GREATGENERAL.png\" alt=\"ICON_GREATGENERAL\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 大将军点数。不能建造在另一个拉玛苏像旁。</li><li>领袖<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/leaders/LEADER_BOOM_ASHURBANIPAL.html\">亚述巴尼拔</a>，领袖能力尼尼微的宝藏：每座您焚毁的城市为首都+2 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 文化值。可在市政广场中建造亚述巴尼拔图书馆。</li><li>领袖特色建筑<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_GOVERNMENT/BUILDING_BOOM_ROYAL_LIBRARY.html\">亚述巴尼拔图书馆</a>：全国建造军事单位时+30%建造速度。劫掠和海岸扫荡的收益+200%。每座您焚毁的城市为您的所有城市+3% <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 文化值，+3% <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 金币。建造者和开拓者+1 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_MOVEMENT.png\" alt=\"ICON_MOVEMENT\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 移动力。奖励1个 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOVERNOR.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOVERNOR\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 总督头衔。</li></ul></li><li>巴比伦<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/civilizations/CIVILIZATION_BABYLON_STK.html\">巴比伦</a>新领袖<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/leaders/LEADER_NEBUCHADNEZZAR_II.html\">尼布甲尼撒二世</a>，领袖能力空中花园：每占领一座城市，建造奇观时+5%建造速度，至多+30%。劫掠和海岸扫荡的收益+50%。占领城市时，该城市每有1个 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CITIZEN.png\" alt=\"ICON_CITIZEN\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 人口便获得30 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 金币。</li></ul></li><li>玛雅<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/civilizations/CIVILIZATION_MAYA.html\">玛雅</a>新领袖<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/leaders/LEADER_LEU_PACAL.html\">帕卡尔</a>，领袖能力卡盾之盛：位于或相邻奢侈品资源的城市+2 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_HOUSING.png\" alt=\"ICON_HOUSING\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 住房。完成奇观时，每相邻1个农场获得20 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 科技值和30 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 信仰值。若处于黄金时代则额外获得10 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 科技值和10 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 信仰值。每相邻1个天文台获得2倍该收益。新时代开始时会再次获得该收益。可以进行“献祭”项目，减少1个 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CITIZEN.png\" alt=\"ICON_CITIZEN\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 人口，获得10 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 文化值和30 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 信仰值。在非玛雅建立的城市中这些产出翻倍。</li></ul></li><li>苏美尔<ul><li>原<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/civilizations/CIVILIZATION_SUMERIA.html\">苏美尔</a>文明能力中，清理蛮族哨站获得村庄奖励的能力移动到<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/leaders/LEADER_GILGAMESH.html\">吉尔伽美什</a>的领袖能力。新文明能力苏美尔王表：每种至少派遣了1个 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_ENVOY.png\" alt=\"ICON_ENVOY\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 使者的城邦给您的所有城市提供等同于该类型城邦1 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_ENVOY.png\" alt=\"ICON_ENVOY\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 使者加成的产出。游戏开始时，获得“制陶术”、“采矿业”、“畜牧业”科技的 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TECHBOOSTED.png\" alt=\"ICON_TECHBOOSTED\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 尤里卡和“法典”市政的 <img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CIVICBOOSTED.png\" alt=\"ICON_CIVICBOOSTED\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/> 鼓舞。</li></ul></li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"文明&领袖改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/civilizations/CIVILIZATION_CHINA.html\">中国</a>：<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/leaders/LEADER_QIN.html\">秦始皇</a>首都更名为咸阳，<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/leaders/LEADER_KUBLAI_KHAN_CHINA.html\">忽必烈（中国）</a>首都更名为大都。校对了所有中国的城市名和地名。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/civilizations/CIVILIZATION_JAPAN.html\">日本</a>：UA明治维新提供的标准相邻加成不再取代原本的少量相邻加成。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"区域&建筑改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/districts/common/DISTRICT_PRESERVE.html\">保护区</a>：三级建筑有未知原因的bug会导致直接获得3倍加成，故暂时移除。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/districts/common/DISTRICT_HARBOR.html\">港口</a>：恢复90<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力不涨价。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/districts/common/DISTRICT_CAMPUS.html\">学院</a>：新增相邻市中心+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值，相邻每个沼泽+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CAMPUS/BUILDING_JNR_REAL_ACADEMY.html\">研究院</a>：移除基础+50%学院相邻加成。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/districts/common/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB.html\">商业中心</a>和<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/districts/common/DISTRICT_HARBOR.html\">港口</a>：相邻区域获得少量相邻加成改为标准相邻加成。港口相邻市中心+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币改为+1。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"奇观改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_STATUE_LIBERTY.html\">自由女神像</a>：改为送<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_HARBOR/BUILDING_SEAPORT.html\">海港</a>。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_PETRA.html\">佩特拉古城</a>：本城改为5环内。新增可以建在沙漠丘陵上。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"信条改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_HD_UTAKI.html\">御岳</a>：<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力加成改为每相邻1个近海或湖泊单元格。</li><li>新增万神殿<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_ILLUMINATORS.html\">启蒙会</a>：肃清蛮族哨站时获得50<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰。肃清蛮族哨站的单位回复100点生命值。允许建造<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/LIGHT_CAVALRY/UNIT_BARBARIAN_HORSEMAN.html\">蛮族骑手</a>、<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/RANGED/UNIT_BARBARIAN_HORSE_ARCHER.html\">蛮族弓骑手</a>和<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/NAVAL_RANGED/UNIT_HD_BARBARIAN_QUADRIREME.html\">原始四段帆船</a>。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"改良改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/improvements/common/IMPROVEMENT_OFFSHORE_WIND_FARM.html\">离岸风力发电厂</a>：提前到<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/technologies/ERA_ATOMIC/TECH_SYNTHETIC_MATERIALS.html\">合成材料</a>。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"项目改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li>重写了项目消耗战略资源的代码。现在只会在战略资源足够时扣除资源并提供加成，资源不足时项目不会空耗资源。</li><li>货运：<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/technologies/ERA_ANCIENT/TECH_THE_WHEEL.html\">轮子</a>解锁。以此城为终点的内商每回合消耗2<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/resources/strategic/RESOURCE_HORSES.html\">马</a>以+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力，以此城为起点的外商每回合消2<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/resources/strategic/RESOURCE_HORSES.html\">马</a>以+8<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_JNR_WAYSTATION.html\">货栈</a>：货运每条商路额外消耗1<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/resources/strategic/RESOURCE_HORSES.html\">马</a>，加成翻倍。</li><li>锻铁：本城商业和工业辐射建筑每回合消耗等同于基础辐射范围的铁，辐射远2格。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_INDUSTRIAL_ZONE/BUILDING_JNR_TOOLING_SHOP.html\">工具铺</a>：造价增加到100锤，2锤4环辐射。</li><li>神学研讨：圣地专家-2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_HOLY_SITE/BUILDING_JNR_ALTAR.html\">祭坛</a>：专家产出+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰改为+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"bug修复","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li>修复了<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_GRAND_BAZAAR.html\">大巴扎</a>无法作为商业区3级建筑前置的bug。</li><li>修复了避风港改名为<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_HARBOR/BUILDING_JNR_HAVEN.html\">军港</a>后部分相关文未位同步的bug。</li><li>修复了<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/citystates/religious/CIVILIZATION_ARMAGH.html\">阿尔马</a>城邦特色改良<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/improvements/unique/IMPROVEMENT_MONASTERY.html\">修道院</a>产出过期节点错误的bug。</li><li>修复了<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_ENGINEER/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_JAMES_WATT.html\">詹姆斯·瓦特</a>和<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/economic/POLICY_FIVE_YEAR_PLAN.html\">常春藤联盟</a>不增加供电范围的bug。</li><li>修复了<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/civilizations/CIVILIZATION_KONGO.html\">刚果</a>的UA文本中不包含<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GREATWORK_MUSIC.png\" alt=\"ICON_GREATWORK_MUSIC\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>音乐巨作的bug。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""}],"language":"zh_Hans","title":"v1.3.1更新日志"}